{"title": "Timmask Spores (class action)", "pageid": 27865, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(class_action)", "categories": ["Class actions", "Ranged spell attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Poison damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div role=\"note\" class=\"hatnote noexcerpt\">This article is about the action granted by the Armour of the Sporekeeper. For other uses, see <a href=\"/wiki/Timmask_Spores_(disambiguation)\" title=\"Timmask Spores (disambiguation)\">Timmask Spores (disambiguation)</a>.   </div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp/300px-Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp, /w/images/6/64/Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/64/Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp/300px-Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/64/Timmask_Spores_Class_Action.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Timmask Spores</b> is a special class action available while equipping the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Armour_of_Landfall_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_the_Sporekeeper\" title=\"Armour of the Sporekeeper\">Armour of the Sporekeeper</a> as a <a href=\"/wiki/Circle_of_Spores\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Circle of Spores\">Circle of Spores</a> druid with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Symbiotic Entity\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Symbiotic_Entity_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Symbiotic_Entity_(Condition)\" title=\"Symbiotic Entity (Condition)\">Symbiotic Entity</a> active.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nEject timmask spores that can <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Befuddle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Befuddled_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Befuddled_(Condition)\" title=\"Befuddled (Condition)\">Befuddle</a> creatures.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 3~9</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/D4_Poison.png/31px-D4_Poison.png.